<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.25 lower. Trading moderately slow. Top $59.50 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    59.00-59.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.75-1.25 higher; 450-500 lbs steady to 0.50</p>
<p>lower; 500-650 lbs steady to 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.75-46.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    48.00-51.00</p>
</text>
